<title>FRANCE: Two wheat ships expected in Rouen by September 5.</title>
<headline>Two wheat ships expected in Rouen by September 5.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships were expected in Rouen by September 5 to load some 38,000 tonnes of wheat, port officials said on Tuesday. The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>In Rouen, one ship is currently loading 13,500 tonnes of wheat destined for Mauritius, they said. --Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5432</p>
